To run NEIGHCRYS, type
   cp NEIGHCRYS_input/* .
   neighcrys.out < neighcrys_answers

In order to use your NEIGHCRYS output files as DMACRYS input, change 'MOLE 0' to 'MOLE 1' in the PRIN line and remove the line starting SPLI

To run DMACRYS, type
   dmacrys.out < SOXLEX_af395.dmain > SOXLEX_af395.dmaout
